WEBVTT

00:00:03.815 --> 00:00:05.043
Welcome.

00:00:05.784 --> 00:00:07.547
Welcome to the Hotel Plankton.

00:00:12.123 --> 00:00:15.660
Mr. Manager, the "guests" have checked in.

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:19.994
Beginning immediate checkout
of the guests staying with us.

00:00:20.065 --> 00:00:23.001
Right. Just as the Precogs predicted.

00:00:23.001 --> 00:00:24.798
I'll leave the evacuation of the guests to you.

00:00:25.103 --> 00:00:27.105
These are valuable clients
who get VIP treatment.

00:00:27.105 --> 00:00:28.902
Please show them every courtesy!

00:00:29.207 --> 00:00:30.075
Right!

00:00:30.075 --> 00:00:31.804
Special espers, The Children!

00:00:33.178 --> 00:00:34.212
Released!

00:00:34.212 --> 00:00:34.701
<<RELEASED>>

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:37.182
Service with sincerity!

00:00:37.182 --> 00:00:39.217
If you're going to travel,
you'll want a hotel like this!

00:00:39.217 --> 00:00:41.685
There's only one choice!
Choose the special espers!

00:00:41.953 --> 00:00:45.411
The Ladies Incident!
The Absolutely Lovely Children!

00:00:46.524 --> 00:00:53.623
Tsuyoku ririshiku habataite

00:00:54.632 --> 00:01:00.502
Zettai Karen Children

00:01:02.941 --> 00:01:08.743
Anata to koushite deaeta no wa

00:01:09.080 --> 00:01:13.949
Tada ikiteiku tame nanka ja nai

00:01:15.220 --> 00:01:20.749
Chiisai na chikai wa toki wo koete

00:01:21.159 --> 00:01:25.755
Mirai wo kanarazu kaeru yo

00:01:26.364 --> 00:01:29.267
Limiter (changing myself)

00:01:29.267 --> 00:01:32.395
Tokihaneteba (changing yourself)

00:01:32.537 --> 00:01:38.271
Hotobashiru tenshi no shining

00:01:39.711 --> 00:01:42.280
Sekai wo sukuu "tsubasa"

00:01:42.280 --> 00:01:45.113
Ima watashi ga eranda michi

00:01:45.350 --> 00:01:51.516
Yume wo tsukamitai dakedo (Tomaranai)

00:01:51.656 --> 00:01:54.459
Ataerareta chikara ga

00:01:54.459 --> 00:01:57.095
Sora e karitateru yo

00:01:57.095 --> 00:02:02.829
Tsuyoku ririshiku habataite

00:02:03.168 --> 00:02:08.697
Zettai karen my wings

00:02:16.681 --> 00:02:17.215
48th sense:
"A Disturbance in the Force! The Phantom Menace"

00:02:17.215 --> 00:02:18.817
48th sense:
"A Disturbance in the Force! The Phantom Menace"
So, we have a deal?

00:02:18.817 --> 00:02:19.647
So, we have a deal?

00:02:19.851 --> 00:02:22.684
Yes. Just keep the goods coming.

00:02:24.122 --> 00:02:25.056
Who's there?!

00:02:25.056 --> 00:02:26.751
Room service for you!

00:02:27.058 --> 00:02:29.060
Huh? We didn't order any!

00:02:29.060 --> 00:02:30.895
On the house, compliments of the manager.

00:02:30.895 --> 00:02:32.464
We don't need it! Get lost!

00:02:32.464 --> 00:02:34.193
Please, I insist!

00:02:34.499 --> 00:02:36.899
Three in the living room, one behind the door.

00:02:37.235 --> 00:02:38.133
Roger!

00:02:39.237 --> 00:02:42.331
Here you go! Some slightly
extreme room service!

00:02:42.907 --> 00:02:43.608
What?

00:02:43.608 --> 00:02:44.709
We're in the middle of something!

00:02:44.709 --> 00:02:45.777
Regardless!

00:02:45.777 --> 00:02:48.075
PSYCHIC BED-MAKE!

00:02:48.947 --> 00:02:49.747
They're!

00:02:49.747 --> 00:02:50.748
Special espers?!

00:02:50.748 --> 00:02:51.772
Bingo!

00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:55.742
And now, to show you two
VIPs to your special seats!

00:03:00.758 --> 00:03:01.986
Why, you!

00:03:03.862 --> 00:03:07.198
Darn it, I wanted real bullets, not rubber ones.

00:03:07.198 --> 00:03:08.366
Hey, hey...

00:03:08.366 --> 00:03:10.034
There's one more in the adjoining room!

00:03:10.034 --> 00:03:13.765
Careful! The prediction said they built
bombs to use on the councilman!

00:03:14.973 --> 00:03:17.066
Damn! A teleporter!

00:03:17.142 --> 00:03:17.938
Mr. Minamoto!

00:03:18.076 --> 00:03:18.633
Oh, no!

00:03:18.910 --> 00:03:19.467
Minamoto!

00:03:25.450 --> 00:03:28.783
Great job, Kaoru! Now, let's get the suspect.

00:03:29.354 --> 00:03:30.446
You?!

00:03:36.995 --> 00:03:40.298
H-Hey, Kaoru! Stop it! That's enough!

00:03:40.298 --> 00:03:43.165
You could have killed Minamoto, you!

00:03:43.768 --> 00:03:46.566
No! I have to hold back!

00:03:47.105 --> 00:03:47.764
Kaoru!

00:03:50.208 --> 00:03:51.402
My powers!

00:03:51.743 --> 00:03:53.506
I can't control my powers!

00:03:54.045 --> 00:03:56.377
Minamoto, please! Engage the limiter! Hurry!

00:03:56.714 --> 00:03:57.681
Kaoru.

00:04:02.654 --> 00:04:03.814
Kaoru...

00:04:05.256 --> 00:04:07.020
Kaoru!

00:04:11.396 --> 00:04:12.624
Kaoru...

00:04:12.897 --> 00:04:16.568
She has minute damage throughout her brain.

00:04:16.568 --> 00:04:19.637
My powers... I couldn't control them.

00:04:19.637 --> 00:04:21.264
Don't worry about it.

00:04:21.806 --> 00:04:24.876
We're all fine, thanks to you.

00:04:24.876 --> 00:04:25.777
Really?

00:04:25.777 --> 00:04:26.209
Yes.

00:04:26.544 --> 00:04:29.314
Then give me my reward kiss!
Just like you promised!

00:04:29.314 --> 00:04:31.516
Hold it!
When did I ever promise that?!

00:04:31.516 --> 00:04:33.677
You just jump in at the
first chance, don't you?!

00:04:34.285 --> 00:04:36.387
Well, glad you look so lively!

00:04:36.387 --> 00:04:38.556
Huh? Naomi! Oboro!

00:04:38.556 --> 00:04:40.925
Sorry, but another mission just came up.

00:04:40.925 --> 00:04:42.688
The incident should occur in 20 minutes.

00:04:42.927 --> 00:04:44.696
Gotcha! I'll be ready in a flash!

00:04:44.696 --> 00:04:45.754
Not you!

00:04:46.197 --> 00:04:49.530
You're on the bench! And don't
undress here! This is a family-show!

00:04:50.535 --> 00:04:52.136
Minamoto...

00:04:52.136 --> 00:04:55.469
We're taking Naomi for this one.
Just take it easy.

00:04:55.873 --> 00:04:57.841
You don't have to come.

00:05:00.378 --> 00:05:03.711
Yeah, I ate. My stomach's full now.

00:05:04.949 --> 00:05:07.485
A sound? Must be your imagination.

00:05:07.485 --> 00:05:10.788
Yeah, I'm fine. Come on, I'm not a baby!

00:05:10.788 --> 00:05:12.190
I'm gonna go to bed.

00:05:12.190 --> 00:05:14.988
I hope you find that missing person soon.

00:05:15.727 --> 00:05:17.854
Say hi to Naomi for me.

00:05:19.197 --> 00:05:21.028
You don't have to come.

00:05:23.835 --> 00:05:25.393
You don't have to come.

00:05:27.338 --> 00:05:30.933
You don't have to come.
Mom wasn't hurt that badly.

00:05:31.376 --> 00:05:34.746
But... But I have to say I'm sorry!

00:05:34.746 --> 00:05:38.116
I didn't mean to hurt her!

00:05:38.116 --> 00:05:40.676
But... But!

00:05:41.586 --> 00:05:43.144
But, it was my fault.

00:05:43.688 --> 00:05:46.418
Because I hurt Mom with my ESP.

00:05:47.525 --> 00:05:50.585
Like today, when I... When I almost!

00:05:53.798 --> 00:05:56.130
Hey, Queen! I mean, hey, Stupid Girl!

00:05:56.367 --> 00:05:57.735
We need to talk.

00:05:57.735 --> 00:05:59.327
Hi, Kaoru!

00:06:00.271 --> 00:06:01.761
M-Mio!

00:06:02.607 --> 00:06:03.665
Y-You're crying?

00:06:04.008 --> 00:06:06.911
Shut up! Shut up! I got some dust in my eye!

00:06:06.911 --> 00:06:08.179
You up for a rematch?!

00:06:08.179 --> 00:06:10.481
No, you idiot! I just!

00:06:10.481 --> 00:06:13.051
Ooh! Ham cutlet sandwich!
This looks delicious!

00:06:13.051 --> 00:06:15.019
My people sent me here to ask you to...

00:06:15.019 --> 00:06:17.722
A Makunouchi bento box!
With croquettes, too!

00:06:17.722 --> 00:06:20.091
So... You see...

00:06:20.091 --> 00:06:23.083
And salted consommé potato chips!
Can I have some?! Can I?!

00:06:23.361 --> 00:06:25.496
It's not like I want to ask for your help,

00:06:25.496 --> 00:06:27.987
but they said we need you
to fight Black Phantom!

00:06:29.667 --> 00:06:30.895
You need me?

00:06:35.840 --> 00:06:39.742
Hm. You came. I was worried
you wouldn't without a fight.

00:06:40.111 --> 00:06:42.647
Good thing Mio's friends with the queen.

00:06:42.647 --> 00:06:44.215
Who are you calling friends?!

00:06:44.215 --> 00:06:45.876
Kaoru and I are friends!

00:06:46.150 --> 00:06:50.955
Well, getting her out here was easy enough.
It didn't make much difference.

00:06:50.955 --> 00:06:55.153
You're all from PANDRA?
Why don't I just take you all in?!

00:06:55.426 --> 00:06:58.190
I'd like to see you try,
you pampered BABEL princess!

00:07:01.432 --> 00:07:04.302
You'll feel pain and suffering.

00:07:04.302 --> 00:07:06.827
You're blind and can't breathe,

00:07:06.904 --> 00:07:09.964
and can't concentrate enough to
use your psychokinesis effectively!

00:07:11.943 --> 00:07:13.843
Don't mess with me!

00:07:16.881 --> 00:07:20.078
How can she be so powerful?!
Her limiter should still be engaged!

00:07:20.151 --> 00:07:21.277
Get back, Kazura!

00:07:25.156 --> 00:07:27.021
What? An air barrier?

00:07:27.258 --> 00:07:30.489
PSYCHIC MEGATON PUNCH!

00:07:33.030 --> 00:07:34.224
That's enough.

00:07:35.400 --> 00:07:37.459
Kazura! Kagari! Stop it!

00:07:37.735 --> 00:07:39.896
H-How can you be so strong?

00:07:40.271 --> 00:07:44.173
Forgive me, Queen.
Why don't we introduce ourselves?

00:07:44.742 --> 00:07:46.835
The girl's Kazura. Next to her is Kagari.

00:07:47.245 --> 00:07:49.113
And I'm Momiji Kanoh.

00:07:49.113 --> 00:07:53.718
I have teleportation based powers
which let me immobilize segments of air.

00:07:53.718 --> 00:07:55.447
Super strength is one application of it.

00:07:56.621 --> 00:07:59.385
If I didn't have this limiter,
that super strength wouldn't!

00:08:01.592 --> 00:08:03.116
What's the big idea?!

00:08:04.495 --> 00:08:06.597
Again... My head!

00:08:06.597 --> 00:08:07.665
CALL FROM MINAMOTO

00:08:07.665 --> 00:08:08.324
CALL FROM MINAMOTO
Uh-oh!

00:08:09.634 --> 00:08:11.135
Hello? Minamoto?

00:08:11.135 --> 00:08:14.730
We just lost the signal from the limiter.
Did anything happen?

00:08:15.840 --> 00:08:17.775
Oh, no! No! No! Nothing!

00:08:17.775 --> 00:08:20.073
I bumped it against something
and I think it broke.

00:08:20.411 --> 00:08:22.847
Just don't use your ESP, all right?

00:08:22.847 --> 00:08:25.683
If you push yourself too hard,
you could cause a brain hemorrhage.

00:08:25.683 --> 00:08:28.743
Gotcha! Look, I'm in the bath,
so I'm hanging up, okay?

00:08:30.154 --> 00:08:31.416
She takes her phone in the bath?

00:08:33.357 --> 00:08:35.293
They're not around here!

00:08:35.293 --> 00:08:37.056
Looks like they drifted west on the current!

00:08:37.395 --> 00:08:39.659
Understood. Take us westward!

00:08:40.465 --> 00:08:42.626
Let's find them soon so we can go home.

00:08:43.701 --> 00:08:45.102
Well done, Queen.

00:08:45.102 --> 00:08:47.338
It helps that you didn't report us to BABEL.

00:08:47.338 --> 00:08:49.040
Just tell me what your demands are!

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:51.476
What's this about fighting Black Phantom?!

00:08:51.476 --> 00:08:53.000
Do you see that up there?

00:08:53.544 --> 00:08:54.779
What is it?

00:08:54.779 --> 00:08:57.339
One of their espers is aboard.

00:09:04.922 --> 00:09:07.015
See? There she is.

00:09:07.258 --> 00:09:09.427
We need you to go full-power kick-ass on her.

00:09:09.427 --> 00:09:11.395
H-Hold it!

00:09:11.395 --> 00:09:13.989
The plane's gonna crash!
Aren't there passengers?!

00:09:14.232 --> 00:09:16.359
Doing that let us see who our enemy is, right?

00:09:16.601 --> 00:09:18.202
A small sacrifice.

00:09:18.202 --> 00:09:20.067
And they're all just Normals, anyway.

00:09:21.506 --> 00:09:22.871
You!

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:28.075
We're saving those people first!

00:09:28.746 --> 00:09:30.448
But, what about Black Phantom?

00:09:30.448 --> 00:09:32.483
Do what I say!

00:09:32.483 --> 00:09:35.941
Otherwise, you'll be fighting me, too!

00:09:36.254 --> 00:09:37.721
Q-Queen!

00:09:38.422 --> 00:09:41.259
See? I told you!

00:09:41.259 --> 00:09:42.157
Fine!

00:09:45.630 --> 00:09:47.962
PSYCHIC EMERGENCY LANDING!

00:09:54.105 --> 00:09:55.339
Patty Crew.

00:09:55.339 --> 00:09:59.332
The plane was attacked.
I believe I was the target.

00:09:59.644 --> 00:10:03.478
Not a very subtle method, was it?
You may be facing PANDRA.

00:10:04.081 --> 00:10:07.985
This time, be sure to kill
every last one of them there.

00:10:07.985 --> 00:10:09.612
PANDRA stands in our way.

00:10:10.054 --> 00:10:11.919
Yes, Black Phantom.

00:10:17.595 --> 00:10:20.731
Thanks to you, our chance for
a first strike went up in smoke.

00:10:20.731 --> 00:10:24.223
I wasn't involved!
I was never even here! Okay?!

00:10:24.535 --> 00:10:25.870
It's all right.

00:10:25.870 --> 00:10:29.106
It's dark, and my sunglasses and
that wig I brought are enough.

00:10:29.106 --> 00:10:30.841
Why do you walk around with
a wig in the first place?

00:10:30.841 --> 00:10:34.512
Besides, you always do stuff like this.

00:10:34.512 --> 00:10:37.815
I make sure no one's aboard and the
government pays damages, so it's okay!

00:10:37.815 --> 00:10:39.216
No, it's not!

00:10:39.216 --> 00:10:41.852
Oh, you think so?! I'm out of here!

00:10:41.852 --> 00:10:44.013
Go play with your little criminal
esper gang the way you want!

00:10:44.255 --> 00:10:46.849
Wait! We need you.

00:10:48.492 --> 00:10:49.823
You don't have to come.

00:10:50.861 --> 00:10:53.352
You... You need me?

00:10:53.731 --> 00:10:56.567
Black Phantom is the enemy of all espers.

00:10:56.567 --> 00:10:58.669
We can't just leave this to BABEL.

00:10:58.669 --> 00:11:01.467
PANDRA wants to oppose them as well.
Look at this.

00:11:02.073 --> 00:11:04.303
We copied your boosters.

00:11:04.375 --> 00:11:05.643
When did you?

00:11:05.643 --> 00:11:10.376
But we still don't have anyone who
can create wings like you can.

00:11:11.282 --> 00:11:14.452
We want you to fight with us
so that we can gather data.

00:11:14.452 --> 00:11:15.920
Those were the major's instructions.

00:11:15.920 --> 00:11:16.887
Kyosuke's?

00:11:17.755 --> 00:11:19.950
It's fine, so long as she agrees to it.

00:11:20.491 --> 00:11:22.760
But I'm not in good shape.

00:11:22.760 --> 00:11:24.395
Momotaro, you go.

00:11:24.395 --> 00:11:26.197
Sure! Leave it to me!

00:11:26.197 --> 00:11:26.731
Mio.

00:11:26.731 --> 00:11:27.663
Yes, Major?

00:11:27.965 --> 00:11:31.492
Your job is to help Momotaro
to protect the queen.

00:11:32.637 --> 00:11:36.334
Got it? Whatever happens, protect the queen.

00:11:39.210 --> 00:11:40.802
So you have nothing to worry about.

00:11:41.479 --> 00:11:44.181
The major likes you and you have a family.

00:11:44.181 --> 00:11:46.206
Everyone cares about you.

00:11:46.951 --> 00:11:48.543
Not like us.

00:11:49.253 --> 00:11:49.844
Mio...

00:11:50.154 --> 00:11:52.923
We were all like that.

00:11:52.923 --> 00:11:54.659
That's why we can't forgive them.

00:11:54.659 --> 00:11:57.662
We were all saved by the major and PANDRA.

00:11:57.662 --> 00:12:00.825
That's why... Why I want to do the same.

00:12:06.437 --> 00:12:08.837
Yo, I'm Patty Crew.

00:12:12.043 --> 00:12:12.843
Right!

00:12:12.843 --> 00:12:13.832
Let's go!

00:12:20.718 --> 00:12:21.582
So, you've come.

00:12:22.219 --> 00:12:24.983
Yeah! We're PAND...

00:12:25.222 --> 00:12:27.247
PANDRA and the mysterious beauty!

00:12:27.425 --> 00:12:28.483
Mysterious?

00:12:30.127 --> 00:12:32.897
Um, I'm kind of different! I'm not with them!

00:12:32.897 --> 00:12:36.267
Okay, technically, I'm with them
right now, but I'm not with them!

00:12:36.267 --> 00:12:39.031
Shut up, you idiot! That's a total fiction!

00:12:39.270 --> 00:12:40.104
Idiots.

00:12:40.104 --> 00:12:41.298
What was that, you bastard?!

00:12:41.405 --> 00:12:42.440
That's not a "bastard"...

00:12:42.440 --> 00:12:46.467
Whether it's five idiots or ten,
I'll finish you all off in no time.

00:12:46.644 --> 00:12:49.841
Come on. I have my orders from Black Phantom.

00:12:50.147 --> 00:12:52.550
You're just being used by him!

00:12:52.550 --> 00:12:54.814
We'll wake you up, even if we
have to kick your butt to do it!

00:12:55.052 --> 00:12:56.747
If you can...

00:12:57.521 --> 00:12:59.323
What's this smoke?

00:12:59.323 --> 00:13:02.850
Smoke or dust? Fine! I'll just burn it away!

00:13:03.060 --> 00:13:03.754
NO!

00:13:07.431 --> 00:13:08.329
Kagari!

00:13:08.532 --> 00:13:10.000
A dust explosion!

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:13.595
She's surrounding us with the dust
she's secreting from her body!

00:13:13.871 --> 00:13:15.463
No way!

00:13:16.741 --> 00:13:18.606
Shall I take you out, next?

00:13:19.810 --> 00:13:22.176
She's transforming her actual body into dust!

00:13:22.613 --> 00:13:24.638
Physical attacks won't work on her.

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:27.785
How do we counter her, Queen?!

00:13:27.785 --> 00:13:30.387
Hold it! Are you asking me now?!

00:13:30.387 --> 00:13:32.723
Wouldn't you normally have a
plan before you called me in?!

00:13:32.723 --> 00:13:36.026
No rehearsals! Do the job
as soon as you think of it!

00:13:36.026 --> 00:13:37.561
That's PANDRA's motto.

00:13:37.561 --> 00:13:38.050
Yeah...

00:13:38.362 --> 00:13:43.033
Her powers wouldn't have mattered
if we'd been able to strike first!

00:13:43.033 --> 00:13:43.934
But!

00:13:43.934 --> 00:13:46.904
We have no choice!
Mio and Momotaro, guard the Queen!

00:13:46.904 --> 00:13:47.598
Spread out!

00:13:51.108 --> 00:13:53.077
No, you idiot, stay here!

00:13:53.077 --> 00:13:53.744
But...

00:13:53.744 --> 00:13:55.211
But nothing!

00:13:56.814 --> 00:13:58.281
Running away?

00:13:58.516 --> 00:14:00.575
Take this! AIR MISSILE!

00:14:03.053 --> 00:14:04.281
You little pest!

00:14:07.224 --> 00:14:11.490
Can't... Can't breathe! I'm choking!

00:14:11.996 --> 00:14:12.930
Momotaro!

00:14:12.930 --> 00:14:14.192
Hibernation mode!

00:14:18.235 --> 00:14:19.497
Dammit!

00:14:21.472 --> 00:14:24.675
They're all fighting...
We have to go back and help!

00:14:24.675 --> 00:14:27.111
No! We can't go back without a plan!

00:14:27.111 --> 00:14:29.170
Plan? What should we do?!

00:14:29.513 --> 00:14:31.208
I'm thinking of that right now!

00:14:35.186 --> 00:14:37.521
You don't have the brains to think of one!

00:14:37.521 --> 00:14:39.089
Wait until we do think of one!

00:14:39.089 --> 00:14:41.025
How long?! How many hours?! Minutes? DAYS?!

00:14:41.025 --> 00:14:44.328
My job is to protect the queen!
That's top priority!

00:14:44.328 --> 00:14:45.590
The major said so!

00:14:47.665 --> 00:14:49.400
Why are you so special?

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:51.802
You have everything I ever wanted.

00:14:51.802 --> 00:14:54.205
But you don't appreciate it at all!

00:14:54.205 --> 00:14:55.272
That's not true.

00:14:55.272 --> 00:14:57.763
You've been protected by
everyone since you were little!

00:14:58.175 --> 00:14:59.767
No, I haven't!

00:15:00.578 --> 00:15:02.239
You don't have to come.

00:15:03.614 --> 00:15:04.915
You haven't?!

00:15:04.915 --> 00:15:05.847
That's not...

00:15:07.451 --> 00:15:11.979
I didn't mean to hurt her! But... But!

00:15:12.523 --> 00:15:14.013
I know.

00:15:14.091 --> 00:15:15.793
The people from BABEL told me.

00:15:15.793 --> 00:15:18.728
That it's the same as wetting the bed.
It wasn't your fault.

00:15:18.796 --> 00:15:22.499
You're still little, and sometimes
you can't help yourself.

00:15:22.499 --> 00:15:24.134
But... But!

00:15:24.134 --> 00:15:28.372
Listen to me. I don't want you
to see mom when she's hurt.

00:15:28.372 --> 00:15:30.067
Because if you do, it'll stay in your heart.

00:15:32.376 --> 00:15:36.073
It might be hard, but it's to protect you.

00:15:37.514 --> 00:15:41.819
Yeah... Yeah, you're right.
I have been protected.

00:15:41.819 --> 00:15:43.721
Hey, um... What's wrong?

00:15:43.721 --> 00:15:44.655
Thank you!

00:15:44.655 --> 00:15:45.956
For what?

00:15:45.956 --> 00:15:48.186
For making me remember.

00:15:49.693 --> 00:15:53.097
But I'm not going to be some
bed-wetting baby forever!

00:15:53.097 --> 00:15:54.223
What are you talking about?

00:15:55.199 --> 00:15:58.168
I'm ready to do my share of the protecting!

00:15:58.168 --> 00:16:00.136
Kaoru! Wait!

00:16:02.606 --> 00:16:04.335
What you lack in brains,
you make up for in persistence.

00:16:04.675 --> 00:16:07.269
Guess I can't say this is all
going according to plan.

00:16:07.945 --> 00:16:12.082
I wanted to stage a close fight
to make the queen more excited.

00:16:12.082 --> 00:16:13.674
But this really is getting dangerous!

00:16:14.118 --> 00:16:16.780
Wake up, Kagari! I'm changing the plan!

00:16:17.955 --> 00:16:21.558
Forget the rescue! Get out of her range
and finish her with your fire!

00:16:21.558 --> 00:16:23.060
Roger.

00:16:23.060 --> 00:16:25.119
You could've just told me, you know...

00:16:28.032 --> 00:16:30.000
Kazura, in five seconds, pull back!

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:30.557
Roger!

00:16:30.801 --> 00:16:31.426
Five.

00:16:31.702 --> 00:16:32.603
Four.

00:16:32.603 --> 00:16:33.404
Three.

00:16:33.404 --> 00:16:34.338
Two.

00:16:34.338 --> 00:16:34.861
One.

00:16:35.172 --> 00:16:35.866
Zero.

00:16:41.278 --> 00:16:41.937
She's here.

00:16:45.316 --> 00:16:48.479
Everyone, to me! If we're gonna
boost, it has to be now!

00:16:49.520 --> 00:16:50.587
Queen!

00:16:50.587 --> 00:16:51.281
Roger!

00:16:53.757 --> 00:16:55.693
Huh? Where am I?

00:16:55.693 --> 00:16:58.924
Question! Question! Am I Momotaro?

00:16:59.496 --> 00:17:00.724
Booster...

00:17:00.931 --> 00:17:01.795
ON!

00:17:08.672 --> 00:17:09.434
What?

00:17:09.840 --> 00:17:11.671
They can use it, too?

00:17:12.876 --> 00:17:14.044
What is this?!

00:17:14.044 --> 00:17:18.674
This is hard! I'm losing strength!

00:17:18.949 --> 00:17:21.552
It's no good. We don't have enough power.

00:17:21.552 --> 00:17:24.214
I guess I do need Aoi and Shiho. But!

00:17:24.688 --> 00:17:26.056
Go, Kaoru!

00:17:26.056 --> 00:17:29.856
PSYCHIC FORCE OF ABSOLUTION!

00:17:41.038 --> 00:17:42.130
I'm...

00:17:42.439 --> 00:17:45.109
I'm treasured by so many people!

00:17:45.109 --> 00:17:48.044
So much more than I ever realized!

00:17:51.582 --> 00:17:54.881
That's why... I want to treasure these kids, too!

00:17:55.552 --> 00:17:59.386
Not just that! Because I can't
stay a little girl forever!

00:18:03.160 --> 00:18:04.061
You did it!

00:18:04.061 --> 00:18:06.052
You broke Black Phantom's spell on her!

00:18:06.897 --> 00:18:09.866
Well, we did okay, but...

00:18:10.401 --> 00:18:11.368
Queen!

00:18:11.602 --> 00:18:12.469
What's wrong?!

00:18:12.469 --> 00:18:13.837
Kaoru!

00:18:13.837 --> 00:18:16.106
Mio, listen to me.

00:18:16.106 --> 00:18:17.674
Wh-What?

00:18:17.674 --> 00:18:21.337
Kyosuke wanted you to come back.

00:18:21.912 --> 00:18:23.641
That's why he gave you that order.

00:18:24.882 --> 00:18:27.510
You have a family too, now.

00:18:30.320 --> 00:18:31.150
Kaoru!

00:18:31.989 --> 00:18:33.149
This girl...

00:18:35.092 --> 00:18:38.118
Wake up! Come on, snap out of it!

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:41.454
Her capillaries are hemorrhaging!

00:18:41.832 --> 00:18:45.290
Teleport the blood out of her!
Kagari, use your PK to stop the bleeding!

00:18:45.602 --> 00:18:47.971
Can you save her? Will that save her?!

00:18:47.971 --> 00:18:49.268
Kaoru! Kaoru!

00:18:49.606 --> 00:18:50.741
It's first aid.

00:18:50.741 --> 00:18:53.107
I think the major could
completely heal her, though.

00:18:53.343 --> 00:18:54.745
Then get the major out here!

00:18:54.745 --> 00:18:55.779
Calm down.

00:18:55.779 --> 00:18:57.041
How can I calm down, you idio...

00:18:57.281 --> 00:18:58.882
Major?!

00:18:58.882 --> 00:19:01.407
Let's bring her back to her
room and treat her there.

00:19:01.518 --> 00:19:03.087
It's all right.

00:19:03.087 --> 00:19:06.181
I can treat her better than those
quack doctors at BABEL.

00:19:06.490 --> 00:19:09.152
Th-Thank goodness...

00:19:09.226 --> 00:19:11.361
Not that I'm worried about her or anything!

00:19:11.361 --> 00:19:12.953
Spot the tsundere!

00:19:13.964 --> 00:19:17.801
Yes. Understood, Black Phantom.

00:19:17.801 --> 00:19:20.861
I'm a good girl. As you ordered.

00:19:23.574 --> 00:19:24.404
Stop!

00:19:27.911 --> 00:19:29.580
It's no good! Restrain her!

00:19:29.580 --> 00:19:32.208
PSYCHIC GOD HAND!

00:19:34.184 --> 00:19:36.778
Does this mean the boost was imperfect?

00:19:42.326 --> 00:19:45.762
The queen's fine now. How's Patty?

00:19:45.762 --> 00:19:47.753
Magi's taking care of her.

00:19:47.865 --> 00:19:50.163
He says it'll be hard to get a
complete recovery, though.

00:19:50.534 --> 00:19:52.866
Things should work out if
we give it enough time.

00:19:53.070 --> 00:19:56.573
Was this all a test to see how well
we could work with the queen?

00:19:56.573 --> 00:19:59.476
Bringing that disguise wig...
You had it all planned.

00:19:59.476 --> 00:20:00.844
You just figured that out now?

00:20:00.844 --> 00:20:02.446
And my playing possum worked too, huh?

00:20:02.446 --> 00:20:03.714
Don't fish for compliments.

00:20:03.714 --> 00:20:05.773
So, what were your impressions
of fighting together?

00:20:06.216 --> 00:20:08.385
I think the queen has skills.

00:20:08.385 --> 00:20:10.320
It seems even Mio accepts her as queen, too.

00:20:10.320 --> 00:20:11.722
When did I ever accept that?!

00:20:11.722 --> 00:20:13.451
You can drop the tsundere act, now.

00:20:13.724 --> 00:20:15.292
It's just...

00:20:15.292 --> 00:20:18.853
Maybe it'd be nice having the
happy princess on the team...

00:20:19.163 --> 00:20:22.266
I don't think she's that happy.

00:20:22.266 --> 00:20:25.360
And that's vital to her being the queen.

00:20:25.936 --> 00:20:30.507
Because, at the most critical moment,
there was no one to hold her hand.

00:20:30.507 --> 00:20:32.276
Is that a big problem?

00:20:32.276 --> 00:20:33.140
It is.

00:20:33.777 --> 00:20:36.268
One day, when you offer her your hand,

00:20:36.346 --> 00:20:39.873
for reasons even she won't understand,
she won't be able to refuse it.

00:20:40.384 --> 00:20:44.411
Because it was the one thing from
childhood that she craved the most.

00:20:45.856 --> 00:20:49.226
Anyway, I've erased her
memories of tonight. Let's go.

00:20:49.226 --> 00:20:50.527
You erased her memories?

00:20:50.527 --> 00:20:53.360
We couldn't completely save Patty.

00:20:53.864 --> 00:20:56.867
I don't want BABEL or the queen to know that.

00:20:56.867 --> 00:21:01.463
This girl is our queen.
You won't take her from us, kid.

00:21:02.406 --> 00:21:03.774
We're home!

00:21:03.774 --> 00:21:05.876
We rescued them, safe and sound!

00:21:05.876 --> 00:21:08.037
And there she is, fast asleep.

00:21:11.315 --> 00:21:14.017
Looks like she ate dinner
and went to bed, as usual.

00:21:14.017 --> 00:21:15.848
She did? Well, that's good.

00:21:16.253 --> 00:21:19.957
Although, these memories of
what she did seem a little too tidy...

00:21:19.957 --> 00:21:22.626
You two should take a shower
and get right to bed, too.

00:21:22.626 --> 00:21:24.228
You've got school tomorrow.

00:21:24.228 --> 00:21:25.160
'Kay!

00:21:26.697 --> 00:21:29.928
Well, she won't stay a little girl forever.

00:21:32.936 --> 00:21:34.037
She didn't eat?

00:21:34.037 --> 00:21:35.698
You're finally home!

00:21:37.407 --> 00:21:39.341
What took you so long?! I was all alone, just...

00:21:40.377 --> 00:21:42.246
Wait, what was I doing?

00:21:42.246 --> 00:21:43.747
Just go to bed!

00:21:43.747 --> 00:21:46.817
I'm not sleeping till you hold my hand! Here!

00:21:46.817 --> 00:21:49.581
You were fast asleep till just now.

00:21:53.757 --> 00:21:54.725
Kaoru?

00:21:54.725 --> 00:21:56.215
Then at least...

00:21:56.460 --> 00:21:58.553
Come here for a hug!

00:21:58.996 --> 00:21:59.963
As expected.

00:22:02.065 --> 00:22:04.134
We're soaking wet! Mr. Minamoto, you perv!

00:22:04.134 --> 00:22:05.135
That's too bold!

00:22:05.135 --> 00:22:06.336
It wasn't me!

00:22:06.336 --> 00:22:07.804
Hug me! I missed you!

00:22:07.804 --> 00:22:09.294
You baby!

00:22:20.817 --> 00:22:24.421
Mae wo muite Yume wo daite

00:22:24.421 --> 00:22:28.392
Kokoro kimete Miageru sora

00:22:28.392 --> 00:22:34.464
Mirai wo koeru Watashi no tsubasa de

00:22:34.464 --> 00:22:38.335
Anata dake ga daihon'me!

00:22:38.335 --> 00:22:42.306
Zettai love! Sengen shita

00:22:42.306 --> 00:22:48.211
Kira-kira shiteta kisetsu ga sugiteku

00:22:48.945 --> 00:22:52.983
Kinen shashin no anata wa

00:22:52.983 --> 00:22:56.851
Kawaranai komarikao

00:22:57.487 --> 00:23:03.687
Yasashikutte atatakakute namida ga dechau

00:23:04.895 --> 00:23:08.465
Ashita mo koko de aeru mitai ni

00:23:08.465 --> 00:23:12.035
Yakusoku shinaide yukou

00:23:12.035 --> 00:23:16.006
Itsumo no you ni sarigenaku

00:23:16.006 --> 00:23:21.239
Egao de chiisaku te wo futta

00:23:22.245 --> 00:23:27.080
"Jaa... Mata ne"

00:23:39.930 --> 00:23:40.797
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:40.797 --> 00:23:41.832
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:41.832 --> 00:23:42.730
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:42.933 --> 00:23:46.136
Lieutenant Koichi Minamoto...
You seem like a very able person.

00:23:46.136 --> 00:23:48.127
You don't mean... You were testing me?!

00:23:49.306 --> 00:23:51.007
The obstacle has been eliminated.

00:23:51.007 --> 00:23:52.075
Minamoto!

00:23:52.075 --> 00:23:53.343
Who are you people?

00:23:53.343 --> 00:23:55.311
I was just in school.

00:23:55.645 --> 00:23:56.980
Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:56.980 --> 00:24:00.313
Episode 49: "The Impermanence of Life!
Huh? Minamoto has been?!"

00:24:00.584 --> 00:24:01.485
How about this?

00:24:01.485 --> 00:24:03.653
No, no! This is way sexier!

00:24:03.653 --> 00:24:04.488
Will this do?

00:24:04.488 --> 00:24:06.046
Just you wait, Queen.

00:24:06.390 --> 00:24:06.490
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:06.490 --> 00:24:08.692
The Impermanence of Life!
Huh? Minamoto has been?!
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:08.692 --> 00:24:09.852
The Impermanence of Life!
Huh? Minamoto has been?!
